{"cwd": "/tmp/flyrig-sandboxes/20260725T064914/webfetch-tool", "duration_ms": 3063, "hook_event_name": "PostToolUse", "permission_mode": "bypassPermissions", "prompt_id": "a4ace60b-6485-4eeb-9945-34c2996cefb7", "session_id": "<SESSION_ID>", "tool_input": {"prompt": "page title", "url": "https://example.com"}, "tool_name": "WebFetch", "tool_response": {"bytes": 559, "code": 200, "codeText": "OK", "durationMs": 3063, "result": "# Analysis of Example Domain Page\n\nThe page presents basic information about the Example Domain. Here's what it contains:\n\n**Main Content:**\nThe site states that \"This domain is for use in documentation examples without needing permission.\" It advises users to avoid utilizing it for operational purposes.\n\n**Purpose:**\nThis appears to be a reference resource designed to help documentation writers and developers demonstrate concepts without requesting special authorization. The page includes a link directing visitors to additional information from IANA regarding example domains.\n\n**Key Takeaway:**\nThe Example Domain serves as a reserved web address specifically designated for illustrative materials in technical documentation, making it a practical resource for educational and demonstration contexts.", "url": "https://example.com"}, "tool_use_id": "toolu_013kY2xv4JjrC6fb51iWRhiM", "transcript_path": "<TRANSCRIPT_PATH>"}
